---
// The Section mark: the State of Alabama. Outline from the U.S. Census Bureau's
// 2023 Cartographic Boundary Files (cb_2023_us_state_500k, STATEFP 01), a public-
// domain federal work. Mainland ring only, simplified to ~1.3 km for icon use,
// equirectangular projection corrected for latitude, fit to a 100x100 box.
// Same path is used for the favicon, header tile, hero watermark, and footer.
